WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.850
Two pupils with exactly the same
weight race up the same flight

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.970
of stairs.

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:06.590
One strolls up.

4
00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.770
The other sprints up
two steps at a time.

5
00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.070
Both lift the same weight
through the same height,

6
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.790
so both do the same amount of work.

7
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.490
Yet one is far more powerful.

8
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:19.410
So what is the difference?

9
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:22.550
In this mission, you'll see
that work done is energy

10
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.890
transferred by a force,

11
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:27.770
and calculate it from the
force and the distance moved.

12
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:30.310
Then you'll find out what
power really measures,

13
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.950
and calculate it in watts.

14
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.130
Your mission: find out what
makes one climber more powerful.
